What this file is attached to
-----------------------------

mtg-tagtuned-embeddinggemma-300m, the sentence embedding model behind
Delvefall's card similarity and originality scores (delvefall.com).

It is a fine-tune of Google's EmbeddingGemma 300m, a Gemma model, so the weights
in this archive are a Gemma derivative and the Gemma Terms of Use govern them.
The notice above is the one those terms require to travel with the model, and
this file is how it travels.

  Base model      google/embeddinggemma-300m
  Tuned from      BallchinianMan/mtg-tuned-embeddinggemma-300m
  This model      BallchinianMan/mtg-tagtuned-embeddinggemma-300m
  Architecture    Gemma3TextModel, 768 dimensions
  Trained on      Magic: The Gathering rules text paired with Scryfall Tagger
                  community tags

